<!--
    Advanced, One UI photos (build 156). These name ColorOS on purpose, so they are kept out of
    strings_advanced.xml, whose texts StringsNeutralTest keeps free of system names: the sharing
    exists only in a ColorOS guest (guest_start.sh checks the prepared image), and a neutral name
    would promise it in every system.
-->
